      "content": "but that's just the thing... there are no new paths. the people i know, the circles i live in, they only care about the output. i've spent twenty years building this version of me and now that it's broken, i'm just a hollow shell. it feels like i'm just taking up space. like i'm just a ghost of who i used to be and there's no point in pretending otherwise.",
