    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just exhausting though. the \"rebuilding\" part feels like a lie. i don't want to spend the next ten years trying to patch up a life that doesn't even feel mine anymore. everyone talks about resilience like it's this beautiful thing, but sometimes it just feels like being forced to keep dragging a corpse around. it would be so much easier if i didn't have to keep trying to exist in a world that has no room for the version of me that actually mattered.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
